Error [E3403]: `time.today` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> nondeterministic_time_classification_is_shared_by_purity_and_folding_2.jet:5:26
    |
  5 |     today :: prep { date.today() }
    |                          ^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine (D-PURE2).
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: time.today
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403
